# Runs the streetwear/e-commerce lead finder once a day at 7am, wherever
# you actually host this repo (this sandbox container is not that host --
# it's reclaimed when the session ends, so a cron entry here wouldn't
# persist). Install with `crontab -e` on your own machine/server, pasting
# the line below with the path adjusted.
#
# Research only: --daily runs the exact same discover -> filter -> spam
# check -> email lookup -> draft pipeline as a manual run. It never sends
# a DM, comment, follow, or email -- it only appends new leads to
# leads.csv and pings your phone/desktop via ntfy that they're ready to
# review. Nothing about this cron entry changes that.
#
# Adjust:
#   - the path after `cd` to wherever you've cloned this repo
#   - the python3 path if `which python3` gives something different
#
# 0 7 * * * = every day at 7:00 (server-local time, i.e. whatever
# timezone cron itself is configured with -- check `timedatectl` or
# `crontab -l` on your box if unsure).

0 7 * * * cd /path/to/gmmarketing && /usr/bin/python3 lead_finder.py --daily >> logs/daily_run.log 2>&1
